{"id":"ec11364efd189aca","group":"73","path":"73/73-ex-carmichael-561-fermat-limit.md","title":"561 对简单 Fermat 检验的限制","display":"ex-carmichael-561-fermat-limit — 561 对简单 Fermat 检验的限制","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-ex-carmichael-561-fermat-limit","aliases":["73-ex-carmichael-561-fermat-limit"],"display":"ex-carmichael-561-fermat-limit — 561 对简单 Fermat 检验的限制","depends_on":["[[73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.4, print p. 518; PDF p. 540; explicit arithmetic and finite-check witness","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-ex-carmichael-561-fermat-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-ex-carmichael-561-fermat-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-carmichael-561-fermat-limit — 561 对简单 Fermat 检验的限制"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7a897c755ea1e057\" href=\"?note=7a897c755ea1e057\" title=\"73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error\">73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.4, print p. 518; PDF p. 540; explicit arithmetic and finite-check witness"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{561}\">\\(F_{561}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf U_{561}\">\\(\\mathsf U_{561}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a897c755ea1e057\" href=\"?note=7a897c755ea1e057\" title=\"73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error\">73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"561=3\\cdot11\\cdot17\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{Composite}(561)\\ \\land\\\nF_{561}=\\mathsf U_{561}\\ \\land\\ |F_{561}|=320\\ \\land\\\n\\frac{560-|F_{561}|}{560}=\\frac37&lt;\\frac12.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[561=3\\cdot11\\cdot17\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{Composite}(561)\\ \\land\\\nF_{561}=\\mathsf U_{561}\\ \\land\\ |F_{561}|=320\\ \\land\\\n\\frac{560-|F_{561}|}{560}=\\frac37&lt;\\frac12.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>模 3、11、17 分别用 Fermat：560 被 2、10、16 整除，故所有与 561 互素的底数通过；非单位不可能有幂等于 1。中国剩余或逐项枚举给出单位数 2·10·16=320。于是单次“失败就报告合数”在 561 上成功率只有 3/7，达不到书中 RP 定义的 1/2。书中也明确提醒还需要更复杂的检验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error","status":"resolved","id":"7a897c755ea1e057","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error","status":"resolved","id":"7a897c755ea1e057","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F_{561}$、$\\mathsf U_{561}$ 采用 [[73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf U_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"561=3\\cdot11\\cdot17\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{Composite}(561)\\ \\land\\\nF_{561}=\\mathsf U_{561}\\ \\land\\ |F_{561}|=320\\ \\land\\\n\\frac{560-|F_{561}|}{560}=\\frac37<\\frac12.","display":true}],"bytes":1424,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-330","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-ex-carmichael-561-fermat-limit|561 对简单 Fermat 检验的限制]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["7a897c755ea1e057"]}